Golems here and what each would use for @member:

- `hello`: seat `member/anthropic`, harness `claude`, model `default`
- `foreign`: seat `member/anthropic`, harness `pi`, model `default` (fallback: asked for anthropic/codex, used anthropic/pi with its default model, because codex does not work with anthropic)

Disabled: `broken`.

Run one with `@isp-golem-xiv <golem> [instructions]`, stop it with `@isp-golem-xiv stop`, check your seats with `@isp-golem-xiv seat`.
Your seats: `anthropic`. Register or replace a seat: https://isp-golem-xiv.isp-insoft-gmbh.workers.dev/seats
